	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『……きましたか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:51:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:16:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『……来ましたか▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:51:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:17:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・部屋に入るとメッセージ表示
　その後、主人公を自動で所定位置まで移動
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:17:28" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アクロマめ▼
きゃつは　かがくしゃ　として
むだに　じゅんすい　すぎる！▼
プラズマだん　としての
すうこうな　しめい　よりも▼
こじんの　きょうみを
ゆうせん　させるとは！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:51:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:54:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アクロマめ▼
きゃつは　科学者として
無駄に　純粋すぎる！▼
プラズマ団の　一員としての
崇高な　使命よりも▼
個人の　興味を
優先させるとは！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:51:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:54:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:17:32" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:55:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さてアナタは　こううん　です▼
ワタクシ　ゲーチスの
えんぜつを　きけるのですから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:52:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さてアナタは　幸運です▼
ワタクシ　ゲーチスの
演説を　拝聴できるのですから▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:52:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:17:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>キュレムが　ひめている
ほんとうの　ちからを▼
プラズマだんの
かがくりょく・ぎじゅつりょくで▼
ピークまで　たかめ
イッシュを　こおりづけに　します！▼
きょうふに　しはいされた
イッシュの　たみ　ポケモンは▼
プラズマだんの！▼
いや　ワタクシの！
あしもとに　ふれふすのです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キュレムが　秘めている
真の　力を▼
プラズマ団の
科学力・技術力で▼
ピークまで　解放し
イッシュを　氷漬けに　します！▼
恐怖に　支配された
イッシュの　民　ポケモンは▼
プラズマ団の！▼
いや　ワタクシの！
足元に　ふれふすのです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:17:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>キュレムは　からっぽの　そんざい▼
とある　ポケモンが　レシラムと
ゼクロムに　わかれたときの　あまり……▼
ワタクシの　よくぼうは
イッシュの　かんぜんなる　しはい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>キュレムは　虚無▼
とある　ポケモンが　レシラムと
ゼクロムに　分かれたときの　余り……▼
ワタクシの　欲望は
イッシュの　完全なる　支配！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-22T11:17:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0601_swsage01_03_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうです！　キュレムという　うつわに
ワタクシの　よくぼうを　そそぐのです！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうです！　キュレムという　器に
ワタクシの　欲望を　注ぐのです▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-08T07:53:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船３回目
・続けてninja1_03_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T08:20:01" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE1
ゲーチス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:57:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
